# Ticket 3 — Printer Issue

## Issue
User reported that they were unable to print to the office printer.

## User Impact
The user could not print documents needed for their work.

## Troubleshooting Performed

Confirmed the printer was connected to the computer.
Checked the printer queue for stuck documents.
Checked whether other users could print.
Opened Windows Services.
Located the Print Spooler service.
Restarted the Print Spooler service.
Cleared/cancelled stuck documents from the print queue.
Printed a test document.

## Findings

The issue was related to the Windows print queue/Print Spooler service.

## Resolution

Restarted the Print Spooler service, cleared the stuck print jobs, and successfully printed a test document.

## Ticket Status
**Resolved**

